     "id": "t028",
     "new_row": 0,
     "value": "Museum is a low risk ‘controlled’ public venue in a City Centre location with access to services etc\nHigh Ropes Activity Centre is an established public facility and will have relevant accreditations, public liability insurance etc "
    },
    {
     "col": 4,
     "col_region": {
