     },
     "id": "t029",
     "new_row": 0,
     "value": "Monitor weather.  In event of adverse weather cancel trip, informing all relevant persons if needed\nInform participants in a timely manner of specific trip information / arrangements eg predicted weather, long and steep walk from car park to Activity Centre, costs"
    },
    {
     "col": 5,
