     },
     "id": "t032",
     "new_row": 1,
     "value": "See Welfare below\nMuseum visit will consist of general walking around and looking at and possibly handling some exhibits\nAt High Ropes, Centre staff will supervise all ‘high ropes’ activities, adjusting activities according to participants ability\nCentre will check participants are prepared (eg robust footwear) and supply specific activity equipment eg harnesses, hard hats\nStaff will confirm arrangements pre-trip eg clothing / footwear at High Ropes Centre"
    },
    {
     "col": 4,
     "col_region": {
      "h": 22.82,
      "page": 0,
