      "y": 462.37
     },
     "id": "t036",
     "new_row": 2,
     "value": "Museum and High Ropes Activity Centre have welfare facilities: toilets, café to purchase food and drink\nMotorway Services available en-route \nStaff will, in confidence try to establish specific individual needs which may require consideration eg medical"
    },
    {
     "col": 4,
     "col_region": {
