      "x": 485.3,
      "y": 462.37
     },
     "id": "t037",
     "new_row": 2,
     "value": "Inform participants of arrangements they are responsible for eg cash, food / drink, remembering personal medication (eg insulin), wearing / taking suitable clothing for predicted weather and activity \nIf ‘declared’ establish and implement arrangements to support individual needs "
